# Public repo: ignore everything in ~/.claude by default, allowlist only
# the portable, secret-free files. Never track credentials, history,
# transcripts, sessions, telemetry, caches or machine-local settings.
*
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!statusline-command.sh
!skills.md
!agents/
!commands/
!hooks/
!hooks/*.sh
!skills/
!skills/youtube-insights/
!skills/youtube-insights/SKILL.md
!skills/start-runtime/
!skills/start-runtime/SKILL.md
